---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  current="/refund"
  title="Refund Policy | LightESB-Camel"
  description="Refund Policy for LightESB-Camel: full refund before delivery, post-delivery review, and how refunds are handled through Paddle."
>
  <article class="article-page">
    <div class="container article-layout">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="refund.eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 data-i18n="refund.title">Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="refund.lead">
        This Policy describes when and how you can request a refund for a LightESB-Camel purchase.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="refund.s1.title">1. Before delivery</h2>
        <p data-i18n="refund.s1.p1">
          You may request a full refund at any time before your customized package download link is delivered to your contact email — no questions asked. This applies even if your payment has already been completed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="refund.s2.title">2. After delivery</h2>
        <p data-i18n="refund.s2.p1">
          Each package is built per customer with your registered company information. After the download link is delivered, refund requests are reviewed individually based on delivery status, material product defects, these Terms, applicable law, and Paddle's applicable buyer support and refund process. This Policy does not limit rights that cannot be limited by law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="refund.s3.title">3. Free trial</h2>
        <p data-i18n="refund.s3.p1">
          The 60-day free trial involves no payment, so no refund applies. The trial package expires automatically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="refund.s4.title">4. How to request a refund</h2>
        <p>
          <span data-i18n="refund.s4.p1">Email us at </span><a href="mailto:nghxni@gmail.com">nghxni@gmail.com</a><span data-i18n="refund.s4.p2"> with the email address used for the purchase, Paddle transaction ID, and approximate order date. Approved refunds are processed through Paddle back to your original payment method; the exact posting time depends on Paddle and your bank.</span>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="refund.s5.title">5. Cancellation</h2>
        <p data-i18n="refund.s5.p1">
          The Pro license is a one-time payment with no subscription and no auto-renewal, so there is no recurring payment to cancel. If a payment is refunded or reversed, the associated license and support end and you must stop using and delete the delivered package, subject to applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="refund.s6.title">6. Paddle support and disputes</h2>
        <p data-i18n="refund.s6.p1">
          Paddle may provide first-line payment and refund support and may request order or delivery records. We will provide relevant records and follow the outcome required by Paddle and applicable law. Contacting us first may allow a delivery or product issue to be resolved faster.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 data-i18n="refund.s7.title">7. Enterprise</h2>
        <p data-i18n="refund.s7.p1">
          Refund terms for Enterprise engagements are defined in the individual contract.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>

  <script is:inline>
    window.pageTranslations = {
      zh: {
        "refund.eyebrow": "法律条款",
        "refund.title": "退款政策",
        "refund.lead": "本政策说明你在什么情况下、以什么方式可以为 LightESB-Camel 的购买申请退款。",
        "refund.s1.title": "1. 交付前",
        "refund.s1.p1": "在你的定制包下载地址发送到联系邮箱之前，你可以随时申请全额退款——无需说明理由。即使付款已经完成也同样适用。",
        "refund.s2.title": "2. 交付后",
        "refund.s2.p1": "每个软件包都使用你登记的公司信息按客户构建。下载地址交付后的退款申请，将根据交付状态、重大产品缺陷、本条款、适用法律以及 Paddle 的买家支持和退款流程逐笔审核。本政策不限制法律规定不可限制的权利。",
        "refund.s3.title": "3. 免费试用",
        "refund.s3.p1": "60 天免费试用不涉及付款，因此不适用退款。试用包到期自动失效。",
        "refund.s4.title": "4. 如何申请退款",
        "refund.s4.p1": "请发送邮件至 ",
        "refund.s4.p2": "，并提供购买时使用的邮箱地址、Paddle 交易号以及大致订单日期。核准的退款将通过 Paddle 退回原支付方式；具体到账时间取决于 Paddle 和你的银行。",
        "refund.s5.title": "5. 取消",
        "refund.s5.p1": "Pro 授权为一次性付清，没有订阅也没有自动续费，因此没有需要取消的周期性付款。如果付款被退款或撤销，对应授权与支持即终止，你必须停止使用并删除已交付的软件包，但适用法律另有规定的除外。",
        "refund.s6.title": "6. Paddle 支持与争议",
        "refund.s6.p1": "Paddle 可能提供第一线付款和退款支持，并要求提供订单或交付记录。我们会提供相关记录，并遵循 Paddle 与适用法律要求的处理结果。先联系我们通常可以更快解决交付或产品问题。",
        "refund.s7.title": "7. 企业定制",
        "refund.s7.p1": "企业定制项目的退款条款以单独合同为准。"
      }
    };
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
